Subject: wifi: mt76: use the interface WTBL before a NAN peer commits slots

The pinned 20261016233029 firmware accepts DW-WTBL configuration but leaves
bootstrap responses unacknowledged. Using the interface WTBL lets the same
iPad Pro receive the response, enter the PIN and verify PASN Auth2.

Retain the committed bitmap gate for established peers and the original WTBL
for encrypted frames. Remove the unused synthetic DW station and its special
TX-status lifetime. This hardware package pins the firmware revision; no
runtime fallback or timing-based completion is introduced.

